  "ruleText": "Arch 305.01 Application and Licensure Fees. The application, licensure, and related fees shall be as required by Plc 1002.04.\n\nSource. #7944, eff 8-27-03; ss by #9097, eff 2-29-08; amd by #9876, eff 3-1-11; ss by #10904, eff 8-5-15; ss by #13362, eff 4-6-22; ss by #14553, eff 6-2-26, EXPIRES: 6-2-36 (formerly Arch 305.02)",
